# Checksums of the reproducible outputs of scripts/build_report_figures.py.
# Rebuilding from the tracked result artifacts reproduces these bit-for-bit.
# Figure PNG/PDF files are deliberately absent: matplotlib stamps a creation
# date into them, so their hashes change on every build while their content
# does not. Numeric agreement between report and artifacts is checked by
# scripts/verify_report_numbers.py instead.
#
# Check with:  cd report && sha256sum -c MANIFEST.sha256
